{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/f4a485532d0b15998b10fc165bf7d4de.poster.avif?t=1769815124\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/f4a485532d0b15998b10fc165bf7d4de.webm?t=1769815124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/f4a485532d0b15998b10fc165bf7d4de.mp4?t=1769815124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are about to spend some time with <strong>Dwight Parker</strong>, a teenager from an average American town in the early 2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s going through a difficult period - and he needs your help to make it through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/087a56e5fbb1454dedddca6ba4cbd2b0.poster.avif?t=1769815124\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/087a56e5fbb1454dedddca6ba4cbd2b0.webm?t=1769815124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/087a56e5fbb1454dedddca6ba4cbd2b0.mp4?t=1769815124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During this adventure, you\u2019ll help Dwight make friends, stand up to bullies, and explore the <strong>depths</strong> of his struggles. Your choices and actions will slowly uncover what he\u2019s been hiding inside. Together, you\u2019ll experience the routines of school life - and visit places <strong>beyond reality</strong> that sometimes pull Dwight in without warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/0cf68ddc602f0e5cd82022d2006c17d8.poster.avif?t=1769815124\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/0cf68ddc602f0e5cd82022d2006c17d8.webm?t=1769815124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/0cf68ddc602f0e5cd82022d2006c17d8.mp4?t=1769815124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore these strange worlds, you may encounter... <strong>otherworldly beings</strong> that seem friendly\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it\u2019s up to you to decide <strong>whom</strong> to trust - and who might be hiding something darker. Perhaps one of them holds the key to understanding what\u2019s really happening.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/84559d213ba22ea4653d6675c3180905.poster.avif?t=1769815124\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/84559d213ba22ea4653d6675c3180905.webm?t=1769815124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/84559d213ba22ea4653d6675c3180905.mp4?t=1769815124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself in a Hand-Drawn World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the story unfold through <strong>vibrant</strong>, hand-crafted visuals inspired by early 2000s aesthetics. Every character, landscape, and object has been lovingly drawn, while <strong>soft lighting and warm shadows</strong> create a cozy yet haunting atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/1ae6136e511d19776040ea3df544994c.poster.avif?t=1769815124\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/1ae6136e511d19776040ea3df544994c.webm?t=1769815124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/1ae6136e511d19776040ea3df544994c.mp4?t=1769815124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in realistic gameplay:</strong> Watch the captivating story of Dwight, his friends, and the eerie Limbo unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play enjoyable mini-games:</strong> Oh, need to whip up some breakfast? Just combine the ingredients to get a champion\u2019s breakfast. Need a good grade in chemistry class? Mix the liquids correctly. Play intuitive mini-games that mirror moments of everyday life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/73dd5ad6e117c0488f1260397dd02960.poster.avif?t=1769815124\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/73dd5ad6e117c0488f1260397dd02960.webm?t=1769815124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/73dd5ad6e117c0488f1260397dd02960.mp4?t=1769815124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>deep and emotional soundtrack</strong> that colors every moment of the story - from quiet reflections to the unsettling calm of Dwight\u2019s other world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras/4d0c035653f92b3fe0f4e638633776de.avif?t=1769815124\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/extras_big/4d0c035653f92b3fe0f4e638633776de.avif?t=1769815124 width=800 height=395 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you are a game journalist, YouTuber, blogger, or streamer, or if you have a proposal for us, feel free to email us at <a href=\"mailto:collaboration@exrealite.com\">collaboration@exrealite.com</a>.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465130?t=1769815124","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/774b8aa280d3e9f1a83b87f969c237ea616342fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769815124","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/895c260ad6b5c89c53feaa9c6d5f4308b6055863/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769815124","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465130/895c260ad6b5c89c53feaa9c6d5f4308b6055863/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769815124","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste